Package: pricingtoolsRmO
Title: GLM Pricing Tools for Non-Life Insurance
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Robert", "Mooijer", email = "robertmooyer@live.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for GLM-based non-life insurance pricing built around a
    frequency/severity model pair: one-way exploration, actual-vs-expected
    checks, partial dependence plots computed on the response scale with
    offset neutralisation, multiplicative rating tables with thin-cell
    flags and interaction uplifts, model diagnostics (dispersion, binned
    residuals), premium dislocation analysis, a formatted 'Excel' export
    and a one-call HTML report. All plots are interactive 'plotly' widgets.
